      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joyuda joosa Paulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ndelo abic okadho, jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam, Anania, okidho Kasareya gi jodongo moro kodi ŋat'oyido luwo rijo m'ilwoŋo ni Tertulo. Jokidho ruwaŋ gavana Felik to joosa Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwoŋi Tertulo to jocako kelo wac pajo ama: “Jadwoŋ! Tel perin ma rieko otieko kelo riwan siem cowo hongo malac, aka wirok mathoth m'otieko bedo onyo pama okelo bero ri piny mawan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wajolo gime iye je hongo je, aka wakethin walwa swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akimiti galin tektek, to akwayin itimi ran ŋono iwinji wac mawan manok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋati me waneno paka jamijokere marac swa; go kelo ruwirok i dier Joyuda i piny gipi, aka go obedo jatel pa Jonazarin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bende otemo koco Ot pa Were to wamako go. [Onwaŋo waparo thumo rigo banja i nger ma Cik mawan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to jasirikale madwoŋ Lisia donj'iye to kwanyo go bongi wan gi mbaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Lisia ooro joma joosa go jowobin bongin]. Ka ikaŋasa wac pa jame maber, iwon ibino ŋeyo bonge gigipiny je ma waos'iye go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda bende jodonjo i wac no to jowaco nike gino je otire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo piemo gi wac pajo ruwaŋ Felik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gavana ooro Paulo luwo, to Paulo waco ni, “Aŋeyo nike itieko bedo jathum banja cowo hongo malac, am'omiyo asangala gi limo silwany ma kwedirok kwoŋ wac pa jome ruwaŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka iwon inyalo neno, fodi k'okalo ndelo apar g'ario cuka akidhi Yerusalem kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda jok'onwaŋan apiemo gi nyatoro i Ot pa Were, kosa ni aruwo ji i kalamo pajo kamoro je i tindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jokinyal kada nyutho ni wac ma joos'iye an me obedo adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a gim'ayeyo ruwaŋin: An alamo Were pa kwarere mawan munyo aluwo Royo ma jowaco ni k'otire. Aka ayeyo gigipiny je m'ondiki i Cik pa Musa kodi i kitawin pa jotuci wac Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abende anitie gi geno kwoŋ Were paka jome, nike ji je, mabeyo kodi mareco, jobino cerino kwoŋ jom'otho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo atemo paka anyalo ndelo je bedo gi paro m'otire ruwaŋ Were kodi ji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.21.17+ACT.21.18+ACT.21.19+ACT.21.20+ACT.21.21+ACT.21.22+ACT.21.23+ACT.21.24+ACT.21.25+ACT.21.26+ACT.21.27+ACT.21.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 21:17-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “An oyido angoye Yerusalem tieko oro moro, am'omiyo oyido akidho koro tero mic paran ri ji paran gi timo cowirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka i kare m'oyido atim'iye ameno ama jome jonwaŋan'iye i Ot pa Were munyo atimo tim ma lonyirok. Lwak ji oyido ongoye bothan, aka ruwirok moro je oyido ongoye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Joyuda moro ma jowok iy'adec ma Asia onwaŋo jonitie kenyo; jo ama joripo bino bongin ka kelo wac pajo k'inen jonigi wac moro kwoŋan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kak'ameno weyi jome wegi jowowaci reco ma jonwaŋan gine i ndir ca munyo acungo i waŋ pido, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 23:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "makiweno gimoro acel kende ama akoko gine munyo acungo i dier jo ni, ‘Wimon kodan nyaka ni rupiri ayeyo ni jom'otho jobino cerino aka am'omiyo wiosa an konon.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Felik, m'onwaŋo otiek tito rigo maber kwoŋ Royo no, ocego winjo banja. Owaco rijo ni, “Abino thumo banja mewin ka jasirikale madwoŋ Lisia otundo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ooro jasirikale m'onwaŋo nigi Paulo kuro go, munyo miyo ye go siem moro aka yeyo merin pere kelo rigo gima go yenyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo luwo kodi Felik gi Durosila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ndelo moro okadho Felik obino gi cege Durosila, m'obedo Nyajayuda. Felik ooro jomoro lwoŋo Paulo bonge to winjo gima go waco kwoŋ yeyo Kristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To munyo Paulo ocako gi luwo kwoŋ tiro, kurok, kodi bino pa ndelo ma thumo banja, lworo omako Felik to waco ni, “Ere onyo eye, abino lwoŋin kendo ka alimo hongo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no go onwaŋo geno ni kono di Paulo omiyo ye go pesa moro; riameno go oyido lwoŋo Paulo adhik luwo gine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo oro ario okadho, Ponsio Festo olunjo kapa Felik paka gavana. Felik onwaŋo mito mako mere kodi Joyuda, am'omiyo oweyo Paulo i jiera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
